flowchart LR
    A[API] -->|Persist job| Q[(Durable queue)]
    Q --> W[Worker]
    W --> E[External service]
    W -->|success| DONE[(Completed)]
    W -->|transient failure| RETRY[Bounded backoff retry]
    RETRY --> Q
    W -->|retry budget exceeded| DLQ[(Dead letter queue)]
    Q --> MON[Queue metrics]
    DLQ --> MON
